==Battleground==
*8 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*12 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*6 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Dober]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*16 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*20 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*30 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stack [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cats]] and [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet the Maikos]] to subdue St. Dober, but don't deploy any meatshields for they will trigger St. Dober's Surge. Then you can proceed to stack [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] (e.g. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], etc.) and [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Units]] (e.g. [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], etc.) to make sure the Zollows don't kill your stack. The Croconators shouldn't be a problem because of Sanzo Cat's Area Attacks and your Wave/Long Distance attackers killing them as they approach. When St. Dober dies, you win.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Dawn of the Beginning]] stages except [[Buried Hypocrisy]], A Dutiful Prayer's name is the reverse of one from [[Dead End Night]], in this case [[Feast of Betrayal]] (being dutiful is the opposite of betraying someone).

